# GitHub Linguist overrides. Linguist scans every file in the repo to
# build the colored Languages bar at the top of the project page;
# without these directives the 680KB cargo-about-generated license
# notice file shows the repo as ~15% HTML, and the about.hbs template
# adds a Handlebars sliver — both misrepresent what's actually in
# the source tree.
#
# `linguist-generated` hides files entirely from the bar AND collapses
# them by default in PR diffs (so a regenerated THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES
# diff doesn't drown out actual code review).
#
# `linguist-vendored` hides from the bar but still shows in diffs;
# right for templates and other small bits we maintain but don't want
# distorting the language stats.
#
# Reference: https://github.com/github-linguist/linguist/blob/main/docs/overrides.md

licenses/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.html linguist-generated
about.hbs linguist-vendored
